1
00:00:00,779 --> 00:00:03,159
(Penny:)...that I didn't understand.

2
00:00:03,323 --> 00:00:05,243
(Leonard:)It's actually a pretty simple process.

3
00:00:05,408 --> 00:00:08,998
You see, cyanoacrylates are monomers,
which polymerize--

4
00:00:12,666 --> 00:00:14,456
(Howard(arriving):)Red alert. Leonard, Sheldon ran away.

5
00:00:14,626 --> 00:00:17,256
(Leonard:)Man, I cannot catch a break.

6
00:00:17,629 --> 00:00:19,379
(Penny:)So how do you know he ran away?

7
00:00:19,548 --> 00:00:23,508
I mean, he's not answering his phone,
he handed in his resignation...

8
00:00:23,677 --> 00:00:26,717
(Howard:)...and he sent me a text that said,
"I'm running away."

9
00:00:26,888 --> 00:00:28,598
Okay. Thanks for letting me know.

10
00:00:28,765 --> 00:00:31,015
(Penny:)Well-- Leonard.
Aren't you gonna do something?

11
00:00:31,518 --> 00:00:34,058
Well, of course
I'm gonna do something.

12
00:00:34,229 --> 00:00:36,439
Uh, Howard, check the comic-book store.

13
00:00:36,606 --> 00:00:40,446
(Leonard:)Raj, go to the Thai restaurant.
I'll stay with Penny in her apartment.

14
00:00:40,610 --> 00:00:41,650
[CELL PHONE RINGS]

15
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,700
(Leonard:)Oh, damn it.

16
00:00:43,864 --> 00:00:45,364
(Leonard:)It's Sheldon's mother.

17
00:00:45,532 --> 00:00:48,072
(Leonard:)A break cannot be caught.

18
00:00:48,243 --> 00:00:49,663
(Leonard:)Hi, Mrs. Cooper.

19
00:00:50,495 --> 00:00:51,535
(Leonard:)He is?

20
00:00:51,705 --> 00:00:54,035
(Leonard:)Sheldon went home to Texas.

21
00:00:54,332 --> 00:00:56,832
(Leonard:)Yeah-- No, I know he resigned.

22
00:00:57,002 --> 00:01:01,022
(Leonard:)Yes, I guess it kind of is our fault.

